# S1 (mer3ly site canvas plan, Rulings 124, 125 and 128): a host dataset in
# the plain viewer. Run through either input:
#   tree.html?dataset=fixtures/site-repository-host-dataset.json
#   dataset.html (the root's data-dataset-src names the same file)
# The fixture is the site exporter's output (merelyllc.com 9df5e96, sha256
# 1b16d990...7eca0): 21 occurrences and 30 explained relationships. Every
# occurrence is placed by the viewer's definition, every relationship is
# routed onto that arrangement and drawn as an edge, and each relation is
# named in the page's semantic tree.
assert snap ready == true
settle 3
assert snap dataset == loaded
assert snap nodes == 21
assert snap edges == 30
assert snap reader-relations == 30
assert snap reader-relation-labels ~ Cleromancy depends on Genet: Cleromancy to Genet
assert snap reader-canvas ~ of 21 shown
capture tree_host_dataset
wait
log host dataset viewer receipt complete
